flowchart TB
  subgraph local [Local SSMR — $0]
    DC[docker-compose.ssmr.yml]
    EMU[Spanner Redis Kafka emulators]
    SSMR[make test-ssmr-infra]
    DC --> EMU --> SSMR
  end

  subgraph staging [Staging GCP — minimal]
    TF[terraform apply]
    GKE[GKE Autopilot 2-3 pods]
    SP[Spanner 1 node]
    RD[Redis 1GB]
    KF[Kafka trial tier]
    CR[Cloud Run portals]
    TF --> GKE & SP & RD & KF & CR
  end

  subgraph prod [Production — budget capped]
    BUD[billing budget 1500 USD]
    MON[Cloud Monitoring alerts]
    GKE2[GKE scale 3+]
    BUD --> MON
    GKE2 --> MON
  end

  local -->|gates green| staging
  staging -->|load-cert| prod
